==Battleground==
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Rui]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1.33~2 seconds<sup>40f~60f</sup>.
**100 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 0.33 seconds<sup>10f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Rui has very high range but lacks pushing power, so use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to stall him.  Units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] for the Celeboodles/Heavenly Hippoes, and occasionally sneak hits in on Rui himself. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]] is a great meatshield here if you own him.

